      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Dear my brain,\nwe only have 3 days for assignment, 3 days, I repeat.
    the past and Future us is probably shaking their head and wondering what on earth
    we were thinking now. let's find motivation, and get this done.\r\n\r\nIn 3 turns
    you will generate level and open chests if you decide to. Each chests will have
    different percentage of rewards.  \r\n\r\nThis game is luck-based, maybe the
    fact you lose doesn\u2019t mean you have skill issues, you just have a unlucky
    day."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
